{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-27","kind":"proposition","title":"平行线判定：内错角相等，两直线平行","englishTitle":"If a straight line falling on two straight lines make the alternate angles equal to one another, the straight lines will be parallel to one another.","book":1,"number":27,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.27","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.27/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":27,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-27@raw-0504c86ce088ae24","contentId":"euclid-1-27","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0504c86ce088ae24aeb5f98206a57da76b998f434b781e62f93d7c39e00f0491","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-27.statement","euclid-1-27.construction.1","euclid-1-27.proof.1","euclid-1-27.proof.2","euclid-1-27.construction.2","euclid-1-27.proof.3","euclid-1-27.proof.4","euclid-1-27.proof.5","euclid-1-27.proof.6","euclid-1-27.proof.7","euclid-1-27.conclusion","euclid-1-27.historical.1","euclid-1-27.historical.2","euclid-1-27.historical.3","euclid-1-27.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-27.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-27","revisionId":"euclid-1-27@raw-0504c86ce088ae24","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"15fabfd0e8ecbacd7da62f04b9383c336ced9e96e860350d1be0de32864ac039","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a straight line falling on two straight lines make the alternate angles equal to one another, the straight lines will be parallel to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一条直线与两条直线相交所成的内错角相等，那么这两条直线互相平行。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两直线有他直线交加其上若内相对两角等即两直线必平行"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"一条直线与两条直线相交时，如果一对内错角相等，那么这两条直线平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-27.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-27","revisionId":"euclid-1-27@raw-0504c86ce088ae24","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"74b785d83369c0f9ee7c16f5182d644a9eda1e07cf329124d9a47ace8ee81efd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the straight line EF falling on the two straight lines AB, CD make the alternate angles AEF, EFD equal to one another;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"设直线 EF 与两条直线 AB、CD 相交，并且所成的内错角 AEF 与 EFD 相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-27.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-27","revisionId":"euclid-1-27@raw-0504c86ce088ae24","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4a70769596aead094788ba935aaa1c0080594eee266333c4710c7128e894cdc9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that AB is parallel to CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"要证明：直线 AB 平行于直线 CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-27.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-27","revisionId":"euclid-1-27@raw-0504c86ce088ae24","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"02e4229b114b411384921f2bc1171aeb6ed5ee75bdd9b56e391c0fc4b423c067","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if not, AB, CD when produced will meet either in the direction of B, D or towards A, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假如不平行，那么 AB 与 CD 延长之后，必定或者沿着 B、D 的方向相交，或者沿着 A、C 的方向相交。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-27.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-27","revisionId":"euclid-1-27@raw-0504c86ce088ae24","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c1b7b59687b414e468bde4d305f0407a9b8959c2c86ac87ec3caf8acb9651dd2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let them be produced and meet, in the direction of B, D, at G."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"先设它们沿着 B、D 的方向延长后相交于点 G。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-27.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-27","revisionId":"euclid-1-27@raw-0504c86ce088ae24","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"59bdfa5b9eedce64dd66a587157309f257e0fa8937757fa9befac610fa4acf2e","citations":["euclid-1-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, in the triangle GEF, the exterior angle AEF is equal to the interior and opposite angle EFG: which is impossible. [[I. 16](/principles/euclid-1-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"这样，在三角形 GEF 中，外角 AEF 就等于与它不相邻的内角 EFG；但这是不可能的 [[I. 16](/principles/euclid-1-16)]。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-27.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-27","revisionId":"euclid-1-27@raw-0504c86ce088ae24","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2a9d4c4186a49aab582ed3e8ec1c83d051bf25ff3fe96663731333216a36d6e6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AB, CD when produced will not meet in the direction of B, D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此，直线 AB 与 CD 沿着 B、D 的方向延长后不会相交。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-27.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-27","revisionId":"euclid-1-27@raw-0504c86ce088ae24","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"234444232083afd8da9b34110dc9b886723009b6530acc3e4d31e01a7c780514","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly it can be proved that neither will they meet towards A, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同理可证，它们沿着 A、C 的方向延长后也不会相交。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-27.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-27","revisionId":"euclid-1-27@raw-0504c86ce088ae24","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"55257d066272ef1df7593ca1bb781734eb0061dbca6f7ed9460c28a864732657","citations":["euclid-1-def-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But straight lines which do not meet in either direction are parallel; [[Def. 23](/principles/euclid-1-def-23)] therefore AB is parallel to CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在两个方向上都不相交的直线互相平行 [[Def. 23](/principles/euclid-1-def-23)]，因此 AB 平行于 CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-27.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-1-27","revisionId":"euclid-1-27@raw-0504c86ce088ae24","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-27.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-27","revisionId":"euclid-1-27@raw-0504c86ce088ae24","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-27.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-27","revisionId":"euclid-1-27@raw-0504c86ce088ae24","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5f63916b7de42d0125a21d2f674276e3f1dee5ea1402a8467df013d0917b2562","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两直线有他直线交加其上若内相对两角等即两直线必平行"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"一条直线与两条直线相交时，如果一对内错角相等，那么这两条直线平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-27.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-27","revisionId":"euclid-1-27@raw-0504c86ce088ae24","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4dbdb243ff09fc7df6a3d0d7ee805f9607549ed945db4c47177dc95b1bac3b0f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙丁两直线加他直线戊己交于庚于辛而甲庚辛与丁辛庚两角等题言甲乙丙丁两线必平行"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"设直线甲乙、丙丁被另一条直线戊己截于庚、辛，并且角甲庚辛等于角丁辛庚。命题要证明：直线甲乙平行于直线丙丁。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-27.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-27","revisionId":"euclid-1-27@raw-0504c86ce088ae24","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"77161aa94603f31733ffc0ee791796dcb1333a85fd785d90c5de5b0a98badcd7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：如云不然则甲乙丙丁两直线必至相遇于壬而庚辛壬成三角形则甲庚辛外角宜大于相对之庚辛壬内角矣〈本篇十六〉乃先设相等乎若设乙庚辛角与丙辛庚角等亦依此论若言甲乙丙丁两直线相遇于癸亦依此论"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"用反证法：如果两条直线不平行，设它们延长后交于壬，则庚、辛、壬构成三角形。由三角形外角定理，外角甲庚辛应当大于与它不相邻的内角庚辛壬〈本篇十六〉；这与先前假设两角相等矛盾。如果改用另一对内错角乙庚辛、丙辛庚，或者假设两线在另一侧交于癸，也能得到同样的矛盾。因此两条直线平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-27.source","contentId":"euclid-1-27","revisionId":"euclid-1-27@raw-0504c86ce088ae24","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9ffd6835b221c315e3bcbe729d088d5a5c84688c9a0d24b8e89289b4f600c319","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.27/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.27\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-27:euclid-1-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-27","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-27.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.27","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.27/","sourceLabel":"I. 16"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-27:euclid-1-def-23:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-27","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-27.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-def-23","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.27","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/read